        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "I thank Aron Keesbury, Executive Producer and Publisher of the Pearson Collegiate English books at Ohlinger Publishing Services; Cynthia Cox, Managing Editor, English, Ohlinger Publishing Services; Vigneswaran Balachandran, Project Manager; and David Kear, Development Editor, with whom I worked most closely and whose guidance and support were crucial to this project.",
